15. Cloud Deployment
Push the repository to GitHub.
Provision a MySQL database on your chosen provider.
Create a new "Web Service" from the GitHub repo.
Build command: mvn clean package -DskipTests
Start command: java -jar target/placement-management-system.jar
Set the environment variables from section 14 in the platform's dashboard.
Deploy. Hibernate creates the students table automatically on first boot.
16. Future Enhancements
Authentication/authorization (placement-officer login)
Pagination and column sorting for the student register
CSV/Excel export of the register
A Placement history table to track multiple drives/offers per student
Email notifications to students when their placement status changes
License / Academic Use
Built as a demonstration project for a college CRUD web application SOP and viva. Free to adapt for coursework.
